{
  "dom_id": "step-4262",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Factoring a Trinomial Whose Terms Have a Common Factor",
  "problem": "Factor $3x^2 - 21x + 30.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, notice that we can factor out a $3$ from each of the terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-21x+30 & = \\\\ 3({x}^{2}-7x+10)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we just need to factor the polynomial $x^2-7x+10$ in parentheses.\n\nWe start by listing the factor pairs of the constant term $(10),$ but only the negative factor pairs since the coefficient of the linear term $(-7)$ is negative.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-1,-10),\\,(-2,-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we find which factor pair adds up to the coefficient of the linear term $(-7)\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-1)+(-10) & =-11 & \\times  \\\\ (-2)+(-5) & =-7 & ✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nUsing the factor pair identified above, we write the linear term as $-7x=-2x-5x,$ and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-7x+10 & = \\\\ {x}^{2}-2x-5x+10 & = \\\\ ({x}^{2}-2x)+(-5x+10) & = \\\\ x(x-2)-5(x-2) & = \\\\ (x-5)(x-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our original expression factors as follows:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n3\\left(x^2-7x+10\\right)&=\\[5pt]\n3(x-5)(x-2)\n\t}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-4262\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"4262\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"1343\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-4262\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Factoring a Trinomial Whose Terms Have a Common Factor</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"4262\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                 